('ielts-b4-opinion-001', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'writing', 'ielts-writing-task2-opinion', 'Opinion / Agree or Disagree', 'Driving Tests for Older Drivers', 'People over the age of 70 should have to take a driving test every few years if they want to keep their driving licence. To what extent do you agree or disagree? Give reasons for your answer and include relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience. Write at least 250 words. Suggested time: 40 minutes.', 2400, 0, 25, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Writing', 'Task 2'], 'State a clear position, develop relevant reasons and examples, address qualifications where useful, and sustain the position through the conclusion. There is no preferred opinion.'),
