('ielts-b4-advantages-001', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'writing', 'ielts-writing-task2-advantages', 'Advantages / Disadvantages', 'Automated Customer Service', 'Many companies now use automated online chat, rather than human staff, to answer customers'' questions. Do the advantages of this outweigh the disadvantages? Give reasons for your answer and include relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience. Write at least 250 words. Suggested time: 40 minutes.', 2400, 0, 25, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Writing', 'Task 2'], 'Explain the main advantages and the main disadvantages, each with reasons and examples, and say clearly which side outweighs the other. Keep that judgement consistent from the introduction to the conclusion. Listing both sides without weighing them leaves the question unanswered.'),
